title: Contact us | Gulf Youth Sport
description: Get in touch with Gulf Youth Sport with stories, results and photos, or to ask for a correction or for a photo or article to be removed.
---
<article class="article">
  <header class="wrap article-head">
    <h1 class="article-title">Contact us</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">Email us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>. We read every message.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap article-body">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Stories, results and photos</h2>
      <p>Schools, clubs and event organisers: the quickest way to send us results, stories and event details is our <a href="/submit-a-story/">story form</a>. It asks for everything we need to write it up.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="/submit-a-story/">Submit a story <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
      <p>You can also email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Story%20idea">{{ site.email }}</a> or message us on <a href="{{ site.instagram }}">Instagram</a>.</p>

      <h2 id="removal">Correction and removal requests</h2>
      <p>If an article, photo or video on this site includes you or your child and you would like something corrected or taken down, we will help. Schools can also ask on behalf of their pupils.</p>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Removal%20request">{{ site.email }}</a> with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>the address of the page (copy it from your browser), or the name of the gallery</li>
        <li>what you would like changed: a name, a photo, or the whole article</li>
        <li>your connection to the person, for example parent, guardian or school</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We will reply within 5 working days. Where a request concerns a child, we take the content down straight away while we look into it.</p>
      <p>Photos in our <a href="{{ site.photos }}">event gallery</a> are covered too: tell us the gallery name and describe the photo.</p>
      <p>Removing something from this site does not remove copies that search engines have stored. Google updates these over time, and you can speed this up with <a href="https://search.google.com/search-console/remove-outdated-content">Google's outdated content tool</a> once the page has changed.</p>

      <h2>Privacy</h2>
      <p>Read how we handle personal information in our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
